{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation complete in worktree bluebottle2-gitretry.\n\ngitutil: added _TRANSIENT_WRITE_MARKERS (the three write-side markers, moved verbatim from event_append) plus the module-private _is_transient_object_write_error predicate; folded it into the transient classifier, which is renamed _is_transient_head_error -> _is_transient_git_fault and _with_transient_head_retry -> _with_transient_fault_retry (constants renamed to _TRANSIENT_FAULT_ATTEMPTS / _TRANSIENT_FAULT_BACKOFF_S) since the loop is no longer HEAD-specific. The retry gained the attempts keyword event_append's private loop had. Budget, backoff and return-immediately-on-anything-else behaviour are unchanged; corrupt-object signatures still excluded.\n\nevent_append: deleted _TRANSIENT_ADD_MARKERS, the private predicate body and _with_transient_add_retry; _is_transient_add_error is now a re-export of the shared predicate (one definition), and all five composition sites plus _git_add route through _with_transient_fault_retry. This also collapses the accidental 3x3 nested budget on the commit paths to the intended bounded 3.\n\nTests: new tests/unit/test_gitutil_transient_write_retry.py covers the ENOENT retry through run_git_write, the macOS EINVAL spelling, each sibling marker, the corrupt-object/index.lock exclusions, budget exhaustion returning the failing result, s3_doctor._git inheriting the retry, and the single-definition identity. tests/unit/test_run_git_wrapper.py repointed at the renamed predicate. No timing assertions; backoff stubbed.\n\nGates green locally: all check_* gates, complexity baseline, generators no-diff, make lint, make typecheck. Full CI pytest tier running."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786605386170159001,"uuid":"16a1584a-fea4-4b58-9760-a61bfb2be063"}